OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785881887
OL,3,CBurglar caught after police find tea
OL,4,Ctowel he used as a mask
OL,6,FAn experienced burglar who stole from
OL,7,Fa Mansfield stadium has been jailed
OL,8,Fafter police tracked him down through
OL,9,Fthe tea towel he used as a mask.
OL,11,FJamie Harris, of Beck Crescent in
OL,12,FMansfield, broke into Mansfield's One
OL,13,FCall Stadium on the evening of Monday
OL,14,F4 May 2026 and stole charity tins,
OL,15,Falcohol, till printers and a computer.
OL,17,FHarris, 37, used a tea towel to hide
OL,18,Fhis face and wore rubber gloves to
OL,19,Favoid leaving fingerprints.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
