OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785881887
OL,3,CBurglar caught after police find tea
OL,4,Ctowel he used as a mask
OL,6,FHe then returned to the venue early
OL,7,Fthe following morning to remove the
OL,8,Fgingham towel from the scene.
OL,10,FBut on his journey away from the
OL,11,Fstadium, CCTV caught Harris throwing
OL,12,Fthe towel from a railway bridge in an
OL,13,Fattempt to dispose of it.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Police recovered the
OL,16,Fcloth and after forensic examination
OL,17,Fthey found saliva belonging to Harris.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
