PN,33303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785881887
OL,3,CBurglar caught after police find tea
OL,4,Ctowel he used as a mask
OL,6,FHe pleaded guilty to the burglary at
OL,7,FNottingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,8,FWednesday 22 July. He also admitted to
OL,9,Ftwo counts of theft from a motor
OL,10,Fvehicle, vehicle interference and
OL,11,Fpossessing heroin in separate
OL,12,Fincidents.
OL,14,FHarris was jailed for 11 months.
OL,16,FPC Simon Ford, of Mansfield Town
OL,17,FCentre Policing Team, said: "Harris is
OL,18,Fan experienced criminal who went to
OL,19,Fgreat lengths to disguise his identity
OL,20,Fduring this burglary.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
