FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785881887
OL,3,CBurglar caught after police find tea
OL,4,Ctowel he used as a mask
OL,6,F"Unfortunately for him he
OL,7,Funderestimated our determination to
OL,8,Fcatch up with him. Thanks to the
OL,9,Fexcellent coverage of the council CCTV
OL,10,Fnetwork, we were able to retrace his
OL,11,Fsteps after the break-in right up to
OL,12,Fthe point where we threw this vital
OL,13,Fpiece of evidence from a railway
OL,14,Fbridge.
OL,16,F"After safely recovering this item, we
OL,17,Fwere able to link it to Harris and
OL,18,Fprove that it had been place over his
OL,19,Fmouth for a significant period of
OL,20,Ftime."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/4
